     as well as updates and update metadata files.
1.3. "Service" means the GoldGram messenger, social network and related
     features accessed through the App.
1.4. "User", "you" means any person who downloads, installs or uses the App.
1.5. "Official Sources" means the website https://goldgram.pro (formerly
     https://goldgram.su; if the address changes, the new one is announced in
